# Todos › Blue sky (5.9): ⌘I opens Todos on the demo project's tab and ⌘1 turns to Blue sky's, the
# first tab. Down onto the first idea, `w` sends it to the demo project: its row says `demo`, the
# others `blue sky`, each with its state — `not started`, or `● built · habit-tracker/`.
Escape
cmd i
cmd 1
Down
w
